  "contentHtml": "<p>단원말,&#160;학년말&#160;등에&#160;학생들에게&#160;활동에&#160;대한&#160;피드백을&#160;받아보십시오.&#160;설문&#160;공유합니다.&#160;참고하셔서&#160;한&#160;번&#160;해보셔요^^ <br>특히&#160;말없는&#160;학생들의&#160;선호도,&#160;성장을&#160;파악하기&#160;좋습니다. <br><br><a href=\"https://forms.gle/GgUAAqmjhoaFxY6s7\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://forms.gle/GgUAAqmjhoaFxY6s7</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a87b3dde7674b99f6669c2ace44932bb2988802f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a87b3dde7674b99f6669c2ace44932bb2988802f\" data-origin-width=\"793\" data-origin-height=\"210\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/833df1e5edf71278e082d47d0aae2d7c672ab120\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/833df1e5edf71278e082d47d0aae2d7c672ab120\" data-origin-width=\"743\" data-origin-height=\"742\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf3c74ac7a57a65466e6d7aad72556bf97090959\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf3c74ac7a57a65466e6d7aad72556bf97090959\" data-origin-width=\"785\" data-origin-height=\"654\"></div><p>생각했던 것보다 내 의도가 먹혔구나, 아~ 내 의도가 빗나갔네 하는 것들을 느끼실 수 있습니다. ^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f6d7779cfaa6cfe1ba2c5811cfa376f9ce90463\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f6d7779cfaa6cfe1ba2c5811cfa376f9ce90463\" data-origin-width=\"1201\" data-origin-height=\"636\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\